{"book":"functions","bookTitle":"Functions and relationships","concept":6,"title":"Four ways to show a relationship","grades":"Grades 7–8","goal":"I can move between a flow diagram, a table, a formula and a graph for the same relationship.","teach":"The same relationship can be shown in four ways: a <b>flow diagram</b> (× 2, then + 1), a <b>table</b> (1 → 3, 2 → 5, 3 → 7), a <b>formula</b> (y = 2x + 1) and a <b>graph</b> (points on a line). Each shows the same pairs of numbers. A pair is written (x; y).","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:356px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 274 120\"><rect x=\"4.0\" y=\"4.0\" width=\"54.0\" height=\"112.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"31.0\" y=\"26.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">0</text><text x=\"31.0\" y=\"52.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"31.0\" y=\"78.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"31.0\" y=\"104.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M74,55.0 L81,60.0 L74,65.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"40\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#E3D6CE\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"104.0\" y=\"65.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">× 2</text><line x1=\"126\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"146\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M140,55.0 L147,60.0 L140,65.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"40\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#E3D6CE\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"65.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">+ 1</text><line x1=\"192\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M206,55.0 L213,60.0 L206,65.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"216.0\" y=\"4.0\" width=\"54.0\" height=\"112.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"243.0\" y=\"26.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"243.0\" y=\"52.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><text x=\"243.0\" y=\"78.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"243.0\" y=\"104.2\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">7</text></svg></span><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:146px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 112.0 187.0\"><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"26.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"41.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"41.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"56.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"56.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"71.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"71.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"86.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"161.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"146.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"146.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"131.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"131.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"116.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"116.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"101.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"101.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"86.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"71.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"71.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"56.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"56.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"41.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"41.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"161.0\" x2=\"94.0\" y2=\"161.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"167.0\" x2=\"26.0\" y2=\"18.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"165.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">x</text><text x=\"26.0\" y=\"14.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">y</text><text x=\"41.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"71.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><text x=\"86.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"150.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"135.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"120.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"105.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"90.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"75.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">6</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"60.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">7</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"45.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">8</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"30.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">9</text><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"146.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"26.0\" cy=\"146.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7A0000\"/><circle cx=\"41.0\" cy=\"116.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7A0000\"/><circle cx=\"56.0\" cy=\"86.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7A0000\"/><circle cx=\"71.0\" cy=\"56.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7A0000\"/></svg></span></div>","ex":{"q":"Show y = 3x − 1 as a flow diagram, a table and points.","steps":["Flow diagram: × 3, then − 1.","Table: x = 0, 1, 2, 3 gives y = −1, 2, 5, 8.","Points: (0; −1), (1; 2), (2; 5), (3; 8)."]},"watch":"The first number of a pair is x (across); the second is y (up).","qs":[{"text":"Write the formula for the table.","vis":"<div class=\"vis\"><div class=\"tblwrap\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><table class=\"ans\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;border-right:1px solid #D8CECE\">x</th><th style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">0</th><th style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">1</th><th style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">2</th><th style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">3</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;border-right:1px solid #D8CECE;border-bottom:1px solid #EAE3E3\">y</th><td style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">5</td><td style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">7</td><td style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">9</td><td style=\"min-width:2.6rem\">11</td></tr></table></div></div>","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"a (number in front of x)","a":"2","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"b (number added; use − if taken away)","a":"5","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"How much does y go up each time? What is y when x = 0?","steps":"1. Formula: y = ax + b, where a = the number in front of x (how much y changes when x goes up by 1) and b = the number added (the value of y when x = 0).<br>2. y goes up by 2, so a = 2.<br>3. When x = 0, y = 5, so b = 5.<br>4. y = 2x + 5"},{"text":"The graph shows a relationship. Read the value of y when x = 3.","vis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:172px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 132.0 164.0\"><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"26.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"42.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"42.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"58.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"58.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"74.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"74.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"106.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"138.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"122.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"122.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"106.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"106.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"74.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"74.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"58.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"58.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"42.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"42.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"114.0\" y2=\"138.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"144.0\" x2=\"26.0\" y2=\"18.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"120.0\" y=\"142.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">x</text><text x=\"26.0\" y=\"14.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">y</text><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"74.0\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><text x=\"106.0\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"126.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"110.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"94.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">3</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"78.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"62.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"46.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">6</text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"30.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"normal\">7</text><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"106.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"26.0\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></span></div>","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"y","a":"5","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Go up from x = 3 to the line.","steps":"1. Rule (reading a graph): start at the x-value, go up to the line, then across to the y-axis.<br>2. From x = 3, go up to the line, then across.<br>3. y = 5"},{"text":"A straight line goes through (0; 1) and (2; 5). Write its formula.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"a (number in front of x)","a":"2","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"b (number added; use − if taken away)","a":"1","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Up 4 for 2 across.","steps":"1. Formula: y = ax + b, where a = the number in front of x (how much y changes when x goes up by 1) and b = the number added (the value of y when x = 0).<br>2. Formula: a = change in y ÷ change in x.<br>3. From (0; 1) to (2; 5): y goes up 5 − 1 = 4; x goes up 2 − 0 = 2.<br>4. a = 4 ÷ 2 = 2<br>5. At x = 0, y = 1, so b = 1.<br>6. y = 2x + 1"}]}